{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"852796889194954762","content":"1. Acidic. Associated with acid damage, evocation spells that deal acid damage, conjuring acid, acid resistance, rusting, and corrosion.\n2. Chaotic (Wild Magic). Associated with wild magic, randomness, unpredictability, and can be used as a substitute for other qualities at half the value.\n3. Cold. Associated with cold damage, evocation spells that deal cold damage, conjuring ice, and cold resistance.\n4. Dimensional (Planar, Extraplanar). Associated with teleportation, portals, conjuration magic, summoning, bigger-on-the-inside spaces, and pocket dimensions.\n5. Fiendish. Associated with fiends, the lower planes, evil effects, and the warlock fiend pact.\n6. Fiery. Associated with fire damage, evocation spells that deal fire damage, conjuring fire, fire resistance, the element of fire, and fire elemental creatures.\n7. Forceful. Associated with force damage, evocation spells that deal force damage, force resistance, force fields, many abjuration spells that ward or hedge, pushing or shoving, and the Strength ability.\n8. Inert (Antimagic). Associated with magic resistance, antimagic, magic deflection, the element of earth, earth elemental creatures, and giants. Also associated with resilience and immovability.\n9. Lightning. Associated with lightning damage, evocation spells that deal lightning damage, and lightning resistance.\n10. Mercurial. Associated with transmutation magic, shapeshifting, fluidity, the element of water, and the Dexterity ability.\n11. Necrotic. Associated with necromancy magic, necrotic damage, necrotic resistance, and animating or summoning undead creatures.\n12. Phantasmal (Fey, Glamered). Associated with illusion magic, senses, awareness, perception, music, the fey, the Feywild, the Wisdom ability, and the warlock archfey pact.\n13. Poisonous. Associated with poison damage, evocation spells that deal poison damage, poison resistance, conjuring poison, inflicting the poison condition, or protecting from and neutralizing poison.\n14. Psychic. Associated with psychic damage, enchantment magic, spells that deal psychic damage, mind reading, mind shielding, and the Charisma ability.\n15. Radiant. Associated with radiant damage, evocation spells that deal radiant damage, light, celestials and upper-planar creatures, the gods, divine blessings, and good.\n16. Theurgic (Metamagic). Associated with the rules of magic, spell slots, magical storage, divination, knowledge, and the Intelligence ability. Associated with construct creatures and permanent animated objects. Required for any item that has charges and can recharge itself.\n17. Thundering. Associated with thunder damage, evocation spells that deal thunder damage, thunder resistance, and loud noises or explosive sound.\n18. Vital (Quickened, Living, Life-Giving). Associated with healing, regeneration, purification, treatment of disease, longevity, and the Constitution ability.\n19. Void. Darkness, destruction, madness, nonexistence, aberrant creatures, and the warlock Great Old One pact.\n20. Zephyrous (Windy, Airy). Associated with wind, elemental air, air elemental creatures, flight, breathing, and objects that can float or hover under their own power.","created_at":"2021-07-09T01:49:33.851000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"862873080724455435","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Orxta","id":"343605682580488215","is_bot":0,"username":"robdor."},"author_id":"343605682580488215","channel_id":"852796889194954762","content":"Information on how to craft is here: https://discord.com/channels/850779382791536640/852831991036641300/862911066883096586\nPlease use the following format and wait for a DM to approve the item before using:\n**Magic Item:** (Item Name, Include applicable qualities)\n**Cost:** (The cost in gold from Sane Magical Items)\n**Essence:** (The number and rarity of essences used)\n**Total Value of Essence:** (Remember, essence that matches quality counts for double)","created_at":"2021-07-09T05:01:02.752000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"862921268666957844","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
